    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything i actually believed in... it's just gone. i thought there was a structure to things, a reason why we do any of this, but it was all just lies. it feels like i'm just floating in a void with no floor beneath me. how am i even supposed to exist when there's nothing left to hold onto?",
